---
name: draft-only-messaging
description: Never send messages (Slack, email) directly; always create drafts for review
metadata:
  type: feedback
---

Never send messages on the user's behalf — create a draft and let them send
it themselves.

**Why:** a message to another human is not undoable, and tone is the user's
call.

**How to apply:** use draft tools when the messaging integration has them;
otherwise put the finished text in chat for the user to copy.
